      "source": "However, it is possible to manually configure __TRILIUM_PH_0__Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS)__TRILIUM_PH_1__ since Trilium v0.93.0 using environment variables or __TRILIUM_PH_2__, as follows:",
